% divergence: shading-colour-conversion-limit
% expect-error: limitcheck
% Scenario: a CIE-based space that does not collapse. A CIEBasedABC
% dictionary whose RangeABC exceeds the unit interval cannot be carried
% as a calibrated space, and converting the shading's colours would
% mean evaluating its function, so the shading raises limitcheck.
<< /ShadingType 2 /ColorSpace [/CIEBasedABC << /WhitePoint [0.9505 1 1.089]
     /RangeABC [0 2 0 2 0 2] >>]
   /Coords [100 0 400 0]
   /Function << /FunctionType 2 /Domain [0 1] /C0 [0.9 0.2 0.1] /C1 [0.1 0.3 0.9] /N 1 >> >> shfill
